WEBVTT

00:00:01.033 --> 00:00:10.233
Heading to the dream,
to the future with no end.

00:00:11.043 --> 00:00:21.253
Holding close a wish,
a wish you can't yield to anyone.

00:00:25.823 --> 00:00:30.723
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:00:32.233 --> 00:00:37.193
The sunset makes the vast
ocean a beautiful crimson shade.

00:00:37.303 --> 00:00:39.233
A wonderful freefall.

00:00:39.573 --> 00:00:43.533
I just want the wind
to take me somewhere far away.

00:00:45.273 --> 00:00:48.403
I always cleared
impossible hurdles before...

00:00:48.813 --> 00:00:52.613
...just by concentrating
because I didn't want to lose yet.

00:00:54.283 --> 00:01:00.283
But who's to blame when
it's not the best that I can achieve?

00:01:02.633 --> 00:01:08.963
Heading to the dream,
to the future with no end.

00:01:09.833 --> 00:01:15.963
Holding close a wish,
a wish you can't yield to anyone.

00:01:16.173 --> 00:01:21.443
Take the map in your heart,
the one that will not fade...

00:01:21.543 --> 00:01:24.603
...and hold it up to the light.

00:01:40.733 --> 00:01:44.793
Hikaru Shidou,
Umi Ryuuzaki, and Fuu Hououji...

00:01:45.333 --> 00:01:48.903
The three were summoned by Princess
Emeraude to become Magic Knights...

00:01:49.003 --> 00:01:51.603
...and save another
world called Cephiro.

00:01:55.613 --> 00:01:59.573
As ordered by Zagato,
Summoner Ascot set a terrible trap...

00:01:59.683 --> 00:02:04.523
...once again for the three girls, this
time using a beast named Vigor.

00:02:04.623 --> 00:02:07.523
However,
Hikaru pushed through Ascot's trap...

00:02:07.623 --> 00:02:10.063
...and managed to evolve her sword.

00:02:18.903 --> 00:02:22.703
Let go of her!

00:02:27.413 --> 00:02:28.013
Hikari...

00:02:28.013 --> 00:02:30.043
Hikari...
To become Magic Knights...

00:02:30.153 --> 00:02:32.583
...they must revive the Rune-God.

00:02:33.153 --> 00:02:37.713
The three continue on their journey,
with evolving weapons in hand.

00:02:42.363 --> 00:02:48.303
The Magic Knights' Greatest Crisis

00:03:00.013 --> 00:03:01.203
I did it!

00:03:04.213 --> 00:03:05.183
Why?

00:03:05.653 --> 00:03:07.623
They didn't count that point?

00:03:11.623 --> 00:03:13.883
That was a cheap coup de grâce.

00:03:16.533 --> 00:03:17.693
That can't be...

00:03:19.503 --> 00:03:20.553
A lie!

00:03:20.663 --> 00:03:21.603
A lie!

00:03:22.163 --> 00:03:24.263
This has to be a lie!

00:03:33.043 --> 00:03:34.013
Why?

00:03:46.523 --> 00:03:47.583
A lie!

00:03:57.673 --> 00:03:59.003
A dream.

00:04:08.613 --> 00:04:11.053
I only wish this were the dream.

00:04:12.013 --> 00:04:14.453
I want to be in the tournament...

00:04:32.373 --> 00:04:34.463
If only I had the chance...

00:04:35.243 --> 00:04:38.673
...I would pummel them
to the ground this time for sure.

00:04:39.713 --> 00:04:40.973
That way...

00:04:41.643 --> 00:04:43.543
Even Lord Zagato...

00:04:45.153 --> 00:04:47.273
Don't ya worry about a thing.

00:04:47.383 --> 00:04:51.323
I'll make sure to put in
a good word, so don't ya fret none.

00:04:52.423 --> 00:04:53.983
I'm headin' back to my post.

00:04:54.293 --> 00:04:57.953
All right? You just
worry about defeatin' them.

00:04:58.493 --> 00:05:00.263
Got that? Now go on.

00:05:00.363 --> 00:05:01.293
Later.

00:05:03.803 --> 00:05:05.393
Easy for her to say.

00:05:05.503 --> 00:05:08.303
Caldina doesn't get it
'cause she hasn't fought them.

00:05:13.243 --> 00:05:14.373
You're right.

00:05:14.483 --> 00:05:18.673
Only those who've fought the Magic
Knights know how strong they are.

00:05:20.253 --> 00:05:23.123
I can be of assistance to you.

00:05:23.223 --> 00:05:24.983
Unlike Caldina.

00:05:26.093 --> 00:05:29.153
Liar! You screwed up so many times!

00:05:29.263 --> 00:05:30.753
I can do it.

00:05:30.863 --> 00:05:33.383
I have a wonderful medicine.

00:05:33.503 --> 00:05:34.593
Shut up!

00:05:35.603 --> 00:05:38.193
Are you sure you want to say that?

00:05:38.673 --> 00:05:41.733
My medicine can make
your beasts many times...

00:05:41.843 --> 00:05:44.473
No, tens of times more powerful.

00:05:46.113 --> 00:05:49.703
Your beasts will be invincible
after having this medicine.

00:05:49.813 --> 00:05:52.413
You'll defeat
the Magic Knights easily.

00:05:54.383 --> 00:05:55.353
Really?

00:05:56.493 --> 00:06:00.223
If you let me out of here,
I can give you this medicine.

00:06:00.723 --> 00:06:01.883
I can't!

00:06:01.993 --> 00:06:05.263
If I did that, Zagato would kill me.

00:06:06.803 --> 00:06:09.563
We're going to defeat
the Magic Knights.

00:06:09.673 --> 00:06:11.503
He'll probably praise us.

00:06:11.603 --> 00:06:14.093
He definitely won't punish us.

00:06:17.143 --> 00:06:18.303
You think so?

00:06:18.413 --> 00:06:19.813
Of course.

00:06:19.913 --> 00:06:23.343
After all, it comes down
to defeating the Magic Knights.

00:06:25.983 --> 00:06:27.043
All right!

00:06:58.453 --> 00:06:59.543
Let's go.

00:07:05.223 --> 00:07:08.123
The earthquakes seem
to be getting worse.

00:07:08.893 --> 00:07:10.023
Yeah.

00:07:11.363 --> 00:07:14.993
When in the world will we
be able to go back to Tokyo?

00:07:15.463 --> 00:07:17.903
Especially with our
guide acting like this.

00:07:23.313 --> 00:07:25.303
Mokona, which way?

00:07:36.393 --> 00:07:39.623
Mokona! Which path
are we supposed to take?

00:07:39.723 --> 00:07:43.093
That way? This way?
We don't have time to fool...

00:07:45.033 --> 00:07:46.053
Mokona!

00:07:51.133 --> 00:07:52.903
U-Umi...

00:07:53.103 --> 00:07:56.043
I believe it would be
better if you calmed down...

00:08:02.583 --> 00:08:06.513
When in the world will
we be able to go back to Tokyo?

00:08:06.853 --> 00:08:11.123
At this rate, I'll never be able
to enter the fencing tournament.

00:08:15.523 --> 00:08:20.023
Umi, cheer up. I'm sure you'll
be able to enter the tournament!

00:08:20.133 --> 00:08:22.823
Cephiro is a land of will after all.

00:08:22.933 --> 00:08:25.923
If you strongly wish for it,
I'm sure it'll come true!

00:08:26.033 --> 00:08:27.023
I agree.

00:08:27.143 --> 00:08:31.873
I'll wish for it too! That I hope you'll
be able to enter the tournament!

00:08:31.973 --> 00:08:33.203
I as well.

00:08:33.313 --> 00:08:34.283
Thanks.

00:08:42.923 --> 00:08:44.893
Now, Ascot, the beast.

00:08:45.253 --> 00:08:46.783
Beast Summon!

00:08:57.733 --> 00:08:59.203
This is Deucy.

00:08:59.643 --> 00:09:03.573
It's just like you, Ascot,
to summon such a wonderful beast.

00:09:05.313 --> 00:09:06.903
Winter Elixir!

00:09:16.593 --> 00:09:17.983
Here, Deucy.

00:09:19.353 --> 00:09:22.323
Come on, you won't
be strong if you don't.

00:09:22.663 --> 00:09:24.593
Now be a good boy.

00:09:30.373 --> 00:09:31.963
What's wrong, Deucy?

00:09:34.673 --> 00:09:38.403
You tricked me, didn't you?
What did you make me give Deucy?

00:09:39.743 --> 00:09:44.803
I didn't trick you. That medicine will
make Deucy tens of times stronger.

00:09:45.453 --> 00:09:49.323
However, it uses Deucy's body
as the source of its power.

00:09:50.193 --> 00:09:52.153
Alcyone!

00:10:16.043 --> 00:10:18.953
To be defeated in a place like this...

00:10:20.383 --> 00:10:21.353
I...

00:10:21.723 --> 00:10:24.193
I have to go back to Tokyo!

00:10:35.233 --> 00:10:36.493
Ow...

00:10:37.303 --> 00:10:38.563
What is this?

00:10:42.373 --> 00:10:44.003
What is this place?

00:10:51.853 --> 00:10:53.253
It can't be...

00:10:54.123 --> 00:10:55.173
Umi!

00:10:55.523 --> 00:10:56.813
Mokona!

00:10:57.993 --> 00:10:59.153
Ms. Umi!

00:10:59.593 --> 00:11:01.223
Sir Mokona!

00:11:02.623 --> 00:11:03.963
What's going on?

00:11:04.063 --> 00:11:08.333
Has Cephiro crumbled so much
that it's affecting the weather?

00:11:08.933 --> 00:11:13.893
It is all too sudden. I would assert
that it is magic, not bizarre weather.

00:11:31.353 --> 00:11:33.723
If we stay still, we'll freeze.

00:11:34.563 --> 00:11:37.023
If this is all caused by magic...

00:11:37.693 --> 00:11:41.063
...would we not be able
to fight back with your magic?

00:11:41.163 --> 00:11:42.133
Yeah.

00:11:45.273 --> 00:11:47.173
Ruby Lightning!

00:11:58.553 --> 00:12:00.313
The magic didn't work.

00:12:00.923 --> 00:12:03.683
I wonder if it's just
weird weather after all.

00:12:04.453 --> 00:12:07.253
In any case, we should look
for Ms. Umi and Sir Mokona.

00:12:07.323 --> 00:12:08.293
Yeah.

00:12:10.733 --> 00:12:11.693
Ow!

00:12:12.763 --> 00:12:14.563
Are you all right?

00:12:16.703 --> 00:12:17.763
Mokona!

00:12:19.373 --> 00:12:20.703
Sir Mokona...

00:12:20.973 --> 00:12:22.063
Mokona...

00:12:23.243 --> 00:12:25.473
What do we do?
If we use magic...

00:12:25.573 --> 00:12:28.873
...we'll be burning not only
the ice but Mokona too!

00:12:30.813 --> 00:12:35.273
Let us go to a town. We can
borrow tools and dig Sir Mokona out!

00:12:35.383 --> 00:12:36.353
Yeah.

00:12:36.993 --> 00:12:38.953
Mokona, wait here.

00:12:39.123 --> 00:12:40.993
We will come back.

00:12:49.203 --> 00:12:51.863
Why are you acting
like you're so cold?

00:12:52.803 --> 00:12:54.933
It's such lovely weather.

00:12:55.873 --> 00:12:58.073
Right, Ascot?

00:13:00.983 --> 00:13:05.683
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:13:17.133 --> 00:13:18.563
What's going on?

00:13:23.703 --> 00:13:26.963
To recreate
Tokyo Tower this faithfully...

00:13:27.073 --> 00:13:29.503
Zagato is pretty good at this!

00:13:36.713 --> 00:13:38.913
Can this be... real?

00:13:45.853 --> 00:13:47.953
Because I wished so hard...

00:13:48.223 --> 00:13:49.663
...I came back?

00:13:59.173 --> 00:14:00.263
Someone...

00:14:01.143 --> 00:14:02.363
Someone, move!

00:14:03.513 --> 00:14:05.973
Someone, speak to me!

00:14:17.793 --> 00:14:18.883
Captain...

00:14:32.833 --> 00:14:34.203
Lower your chin.

00:14:34.303 --> 00:14:35.773
Elbows like this!

00:14:36.203 --> 00:14:37.173
That's it.

00:14:37.273 --> 00:14:38.713
It's looking better.

00:14:40.383 --> 00:14:42.143
Thank you, Captain.

00:14:42.613 --> 00:14:46.483
Stop calling me captain.
You're the captain of the team now.

00:14:47.423 --> 00:14:51.113
But to me, you're still
my captain, Captain.

00:14:52.193 --> 00:14:56.063
Such a troublemaker. Well, good
luck in the next tournament.

00:14:56.163 --> 00:15:00.123
I want you to win this year and
bring the championship flag back!

00:15:00.433 --> 00:15:01.403
Right!

00:15:04.603 --> 00:15:05.763
So cruel...

00:15:06.503 --> 00:15:09.333
I was finally able
to come back to Tokyo...

00:15:09.643 --> 00:15:12.573
I can finally enter
the fencing tournament...

00:15:13.413 --> 00:15:14.383
Why?

00:15:15.283 --> 00:15:17.403
Why won't anyone move?

00:15:19.283 --> 00:15:20.413
Captain...

00:15:21.323 --> 00:15:26.313
I'll wish for it too! That I hope you'll
be able to enter the tournament!

00:15:26.423 --> 00:15:28.453
I as well, Ms. Umi.

00:15:30.033 --> 00:15:31.253
Hikaru! Fuu!

00:15:44.413 --> 00:15:45.703
Ms. Hikaru...

00:15:48.783 --> 00:15:50.113
What's wrong, Fuu?

00:15:52.483 --> 00:15:53.453
Mokona!

00:15:54.223 --> 00:15:55.313
How...

00:15:55.823 --> 00:15:57.443
We walked so much...

00:15:58.723 --> 00:16:03.353
It seems that we have somehow
wandered into an enclosed world.

00:16:04.093 --> 00:16:06.063
Then it is magic after all?

00:16:31.323 --> 00:16:32.413
Fuu...

00:16:33.763 --> 00:16:34.853
You can't...

00:16:35.293 --> 00:16:37.023
You have to hold...

00:16:42.463 --> 00:16:43.563
Umi...

00:17:04.423 --> 00:17:07.183
To let such children
have their way with me...

00:17:07.993 --> 00:17:10.753
And as a result,
Lord Zagato has neglected me.

00:17:11.433 --> 00:17:12.363
Two?

00:17:12.793 --> 00:17:15.193
There's one missing.
That's impossible!

00:17:15.303 --> 00:17:17.593
I don't remember
letting one get away!

00:17:18.873 --> 00:17:20.733
What happened to the other one?

00:17:20.843 --> 00:17:22.533
Where did she go?

00:17:33.383 --> 00:17:35.823
I wonder what
happened to Hikaru and Fuu.

00:17:36.623 --> 00:17:38.213
They're not here...

00:17:39.523 --> 00:17:41.283
Could that light have...

00:17:41.793 --> 00:17:43.263
That can't be.

00:17:43.533 --> 00:17:46.363
Hikaru and Fuu
can use such amazing magic.

00:17:46.463 --> 00:17:50.123
They must be... They must
be alive somewhere in Cephiro.

00:17:50.333 --> 00:17:51.893
Umi!

00:17:52.973 --> 00:17:53.993
Hikaru!

00:17:59.343 --> 00:18:00.433
This place...

00:18:14.923 --> 00:18:16.863
No, this isn't Tokyo.

00:18:17.893 --> 00:18:20.333
It's a world that my heart created...

00:18:21.203 --> 00:18:23.133
A world of indecision!

00:18:26.733 --> 00:18:28.203
I'm going back.

00:18:28.503 --> 00:18:30.773
Back to where Hikaru and Fuu are.

00:18:33.683 --> 00:18:34.773
To...

00:18:36.483 --> 00:18:37.503
To...

00:18:41.723 --> 00:18:44.153
To the place where
I'm supposed to go!

00:18:49.723 --> 00:18:50.853
Hikaru!

00:18:50.963 --> 00:18:51.933
Fuu!

00:18:58.373 --> 00:18:59.233
You!

00:19:06.713 --> 00:19:09.183
I thought you looked familiar.

00:19:10.083 --> 00:19:14.523
If it isn't the old hag who screwed up
in the Forest of Silence and Eterna!

00:19:16.893 --> 00:19:20.083
Don't be so persistent.
People can hate you for that!

00:19:20.993 --> 00:19:22.463
What was that?

00:19:28.463 --> 00:19:30.693
I'm surprised you blocked this.

00:19:30.803 --> 00:19:33.103
I give you my compliments.

00:19:33.203 --> 00:19:35.333
However, this is the end!

00:19:39.413 --> 00:19:42.043
What were you so arrogant for?

00:19:42.883 --> 00:19:44.313
It's already over.

00:19:45.883 --> 00:19:49.943
Goodbye, fledgling Magic Knight.

00:19:51.353 --> 00:19:53.123
I can't lose.

00:19:58.393 --> 00:19:59.383
I...

00:20:01.003 --> 00:20:02.993
I can't...

00:20:04.373 --> 00:20:05.963
...lose!

00:20:14.413 --> 00:20:15.743
What's this?

00:20:22.623 --> 00:20:24.053
It evolved?

00:20:54.653 --> 00:20:55.623
Hikaru.

00:20:56.123 --> 00:20:57.183
Hikaru!

00:20:59.793 --> 00:21:00.913
Umi!

00:21:01.023 --> 00:21:02.513
Where were you?

00:21:02.623 --> 00:21:04.683
Really, we were worried.

00:21:06.363 --> 00:21:08.093
Fuu! Mokona!

00:21:08.203 --> 00:21:09.823
You're all right?

00:21:09.933 --> 00:21:11.063
I'm sorry.

00:21:12.103 --> 00:21:13.693
I was dreaming.

00:21:13.803 --> 00:21:14.833
Dreaming?

00:21:15.943 --> 00:21:17.063
Hikaru.

00:21:17.173 --> 00:21:18.303
Fuu.

00:21:18.413 --> 00:21:22.043
We'll go back to Tokyo after
the three of us save Cephiro!

00:21:23.343 --> 00:21:24.053
Yeah!

00:21:24.053 --> 00:21:25.013
Yeah!
Y-Yes...

00:21:27.983 --> 00:21:29.183
Until then...

00:21:30.083 --> 00:21:32.023
Please wait for me...

00:21:32.353 --> 00:21:33.453
...Captain.

00:21:34.393 --> 00:21:35.363
Shit!

00:21:36.963 --> 00:21:39.363
How dare she do that to my Deucy...

00:21:40.093 --> 00:21:42.863
This was a result of your foolishness.

00:21:43.103 --> 00:21:46.863
But before that, don't you have
something to tell Lord Zagato?

00:21:48.543 --> 00:21:50.303
I'm sorry, Zagato.

00:21:51.113 --> 00:21:52.543
Is that it?

00:21:52.813 --> 00:21:55.973
Ascot was fooled
by Alcyone, nothin' more.

00:21:56.043 --> 00:21:58.543
Ya don't have to blame just him.

00:22:00.983 --> 00:22:03.923
I'll let it go today for Caldina's sake.

00:22:05.993 --> 00:22:08.463
The next mistake will not be forgiven.

00:22:11.263 --> 00:22:12.353
I know.

00:22:12.963 --> 00:22:14.223
Next time...

00:22:15.263 --> 00:22:16.703
Definitely.

00:22:26.773 --> 00:22:31.183
Put the best smile
you can on your face...

00:22:32.753 --> 00:22:38.343
...and push down on that
pedal as hard as you can.

00:22:39.793 --> 00:22:45.353
Even if a really
strong wind blows against you...

00:22:46.093 --> 00:22:49.933
...don't give up hope so easily.

00:22:52.233 --> 00:22:55.403
Head for the big blue sea
that whispers in your ear...

00:22:55.603 --> 00:22:58.043
...what you really
need to know right now.

00:22:59.143 --> 00:23:02.943
Power that lets you
win over your tears.

00:23:03.983 --> 00:23:10.613
Now do the best that you can!
Your eyes will be someday soon...

00:23:11.353 --> 00:23:16.623
...basking in warm sunlight
and will start to shimmer.

00:23:16.993 --> 00:23:23.793
Just keep believing yourself
and never, ever give up...

00:23:24.303 --> 00:23:29.743
Your faith becomes
courage to live one more day.

00:23:46.153 --> 00:23:48.283
I'm Hikaru Shidou!

00:23:48.823 --> 00:23:52.853
We dove underwater in
a capsule that Mokona brought out.

00:23:52.963 --> 00:23:56.563
Suddenly, a beautiful shrine
appeared in front of our eyes.

00:23:56.663 --> 00:23:59.933
And when we entered the shrine...

00:24:00.073 --> 00:24:03.003
...there was
a huge plaque of a dragon!

00:24:03.503 --> 00:24:06.273
The first Magic Knight
Rayearth of the new year...

00:24:06.373 --> 00:24:09.283
Revival of Selece,
the Legendary Rune-God.

00:24:09.383 --> 00:24:12.353
Revival of Selece,
the Legendary Rune-God
You have to watch next year too!

00:24:12.353 --> 00:24:13.383
Revival of Selece,
the Legendary Rune-God

00:24:13.383 --> 00:24:20.313
Who is it today?

00:24:21.493 --> 00:24:23.293
Today, it's Hikaru!

00:24:23.393 --> 00:24:24.033
Look forward to the next episode!

00:24:24.033 --> 00:24:26.933
Look forward to the next episode!
Hey, everyone! Did you guess right?

00:24:26.933 --> 00:24:28.403
Look forward to the next episode!
See you later!

00:24:28.403 --> 00:24:29.363
Look forward to the next episode!
